cloud-architecture-diagram

direction right
typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel

People [label: "Human Participants"] {
  Engineer [label: "Engineer"]
  Reviewer [label: "Reviewer or Approver"]
  Operator [label: "Platform Operator"]
}

RADF [label: "RADF AI-Native Delivery Platform"] {
  Intake [label: "Intent and Project Policy"]
  ControlPlane [label: "RADF Control Plane"]
  AgentRuntime [label: "Constrained Agent Runtime"]
  Verification [label: "Independent Verification"]
  Evidence [label: "Evidence and Audit"]
}

EngineeringSystems [label: "Engineering Systems"] {
  Git [label: "GitHub or GitLab"]
  CI [label: "CI and Security Systems"]
  Registry [label: "Artifact Registry"]
  Cloud [label: "Cloud or Kubernetes"]
  Observability [label: "Observability"]
}

AIProviders [label: "AI and Knowledge Providers"] {
  Models [label: "Approved Model Providers"]
  Knowledge [label: "Project Context and Knowledge"]
}

Engineer > Intake: Approved engineering intent
Intake > ControlPlane: Task and policy context
ControlPlane > Models: Approved model invocation
ControlPlane > Knowledge: Project-scoped retrieval
ControlPlane > AgentRuntime: Authorized task execution
AgentRuntime > Git: Read or proposed code change
AgentRuntime > CI: Trigger permitted checks
Verification > CI: Deterministic verification
Verification > ControlPlane: Pass, fail or findings
ControlPlane > Reviewer: Approval request when required
Reviewer > ControlPlane: Attributable decision
ControlPlane > Cloud: Authorized deployment action
Registry > Cloud: Exact immutable artifact
ControlPlane > Evidence: Workflow and authorization events
AgentRuntime > Evidence: Tool and execution events
Verification > Evidence: Test and security evidence
Cloud > Observability: Runtime health
Observability > Operator: Alerts and operational evidence

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [connection: >, label: "Request, action or evidence flow"]
}
